OL,3,GNEWSACyclists take starring role on
OL,4,AScottish Borders stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish Borders formed the
OL,7,Fbackdrop for two major cycling events
OL,8,Fon Sunday.
OL,10,FProfessional racers sped along a route
OL,11,Fstarting and finishing in Earlston as
OL,12,Fit hosted the final stage of the Tour
OL,13,Fof Britain.
OL,15,FGerman rider Nils Politt won the stage
OL,16,Fwhile teammate Tim Wellens from Belgium
OL,17,Ffinished first in the overall
OL,18,Fstandings.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
