OL,3,GNEWSACyclists take starring role on
OL,4,AScottish Borders stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FFurther west in the region, thousands
OL,7,Fof amateur cyclists took part in the
OL,8,FTour O The Borders closed roads event
OL,9,Fwhich started and finished in Peebles.
